# Read by ripgrep and, through it, VS Code search (and other .ignore-aware tools).
# `.gitignore` excludes `node_modules/`, which also drops it from search. This file
# re-includes just the pi harness packages this extension is written against, so
# their types and source stay searchable in the editor without committing them.
#
# Idiom: un-ignore node_modules, re-ignore its direct children, then keep only the
# @earendil-works packages.
!node_modules/
node_modules/*
!node_modules/@earendil-works/

# Those packages vendor their own transitive deps; drop that third-party noise but
# keep the nested pi packages (pi-ai, pi-agent-core live under pi-coding-agent).
node_modules/@earendil-works/**/node_modules/*
!node_modules/@earendil-works/**/node_modules/@earendil-works/

# Sourcemaps are not worth searching.
*.map
